124197","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"This poster describes a within subject-study of navigation with cognitive mental map based on visualization of sonic echoes in a dark virtual environment (VE). Participants experienced navigation in two conditions: Light (directional lights turned on) and Dark (directional lights switched off). In both conditions participants could send the visualized audio signal, thus in the Dark condition it was the only possible visualized navigational option. The results suggest that participants were able to create a cognitive mental map, for both conditions, and were also able to perform spatial localization and navigation.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Leopold Hyldig Rosenkvist, Amalie","Sebastian Eriksen, David","Køhlert, Jeppe","Valimaa, Miicha","Brogaard Vittrup, Mikkel","Andreasen, Anastassia","Palamas, George"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-072343"],"event":{"acronym":"VR","end":"2019-03-27","place":"Osaka, jp","start":"2019-03-23","title":"2019 IEEE Conference on Virtual Reality and 3D User Interfaces (VR)","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Echolocation","Human","Human centered computing","Human centered design","Phenomenological Method","Sound","Virtual Reality VR","Virtual reality","Visualization design and evaluation methods","Visualization techniques"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hearing with eyes in virtual reality","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85071862387&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-072343","identifier":[{"id":"85071862387","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-4ce38cce-be36-44fb-bbeb-1baaa9cc413e"],"keyword":["Ce